Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.32,0:00:05.72,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And a tournament that has already produced headlines in its opening three days,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开赛三天 赛事头条不断
