Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:44.16,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, if it's worrying, she's moving pretty well today already.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N即便有担忧 她的移动仍出色
