Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:51.10,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}次盘又以{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:11.58,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}但从{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}到{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 她连输{\fs78}4{\fs68}局
