Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:18.70,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Of course, four games on the trot means she broke twice as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N连赢四局 期间两次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.74,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Sabalenka has to reclaim her focus.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡必须重新集中注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.50,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You can see already on the opening point, Ann Li rejuvenated.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N开局这一分 李吉妮重拾精神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.90,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's starting to feel her game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她开始找回自己的比赛感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:35.64,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}决胜盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 萨巴伦卡陷入绝境
