Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.69,0:01:41.68,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}第十局再救两个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:01:59.20,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She needs one big time here.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这时她迫切需要一记好发球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:11.22,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Now she got that first serve in, but it didn't do her any good.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次一发进了 仍没拿下这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.04,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sabalenka is back in the mix.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N萨巴伦卡重新回到争夺之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.62,0:02:14.46,TL,,0,0,363,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's fired up.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的斗志燃起来了
